      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Upload your own images on the three image nodes. The first scene travels from an opening guide to a closing guide. The second has one opening guide. Chain more frame cards to extend the sequence. Disconnect the frame stack for text-only generation. Each additional frame pair can generate a billed shot. Edit the cast cards to change who speaks."
      ],
